dc06d11bff8f8ef8c07eeb8ee08172.mp4?t=1756981973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re looking for a productivity companion, an interactive VTuber-style friend, or just a fun, tsundere-infused desktop experience—<strong>My Desktop Sister</strong> is here to stay (whether she admits she likes you or not).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669330/extras/3abcc955e867478f639641ca042c9939.poster.avif?t=1756981973\" width=800 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669330/extras/3abcc955e867478f639641ca042c9939.webm?t=1756981973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669330/extras/3abcc955e867478f639641ca042c9939.mp4?t=1756981973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
